			rgCommunityRecommendations: [{"appid":208650,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"230523814","appid":208650,"accountid":239501578,"playtime_at_review":3442,"review_text":"Almost everything about Batman Arkham Knight is perfect. The story, combat, atmosphere, and gameplay make it one of the best superhero games ever made. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198199767306\/recommended\/208650\/","votes_up":9}]},{"appid":3751950,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"230554304","appid":3751950,"accountid":177633811,"playtime_at_review":1541,"review_text":"Wow. I must give props where it's due, but Ubisoft did not drop the ball on this one. This is the most I've truly enjoyed an AC game release since like Unity. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198137899539\/recommended\/3751950\/","votes_up":27},{"recommendationid":"230582175","appid":3751950,"accountid":1704358538,"playtime_at_review":2225,"review_text":"Assassin\u2019s Creed finally feels addictive again. I spent the entire weekend playing Black Flag Resynced, and honestly, this is one of the best Assassin\u2019s Creed games we\u2019ve had in a long time. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561199664624266\/recommended\/3751950\/","votes_up":6},{"recommendationid":"230571726","appid":3751950,"accountid":35487749,"playtime_at_review":1788,"review_text":"QoL aside, it's the game we all know and love. The QoL is a nice addition. I miss the modern day scenes, only AC fan that does apparently. It's missing a multiplayer mode unfortunately. I miss those too. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561197995753477\/recommended\/3751950\/","votes_up":6}]},{"appid":3552140,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"230572044","appid":3552140,"accountid":48214940,"playtime_at_review":924,"review_text":"I absolutely love this game. Building up my own video store, decorating the shelves, expanding the shop, and deciding what to stock is exactly what I was looking for. The retro atmosphere ties everything together perfectly.","review_text_truncated":false,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198008480668\/recommended\/3552140\/","votes_up":8}]},{"appid":3767850,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"230557620","appid":3767850,"accountid":171367552,"playtime_at_review":258,"review_text":"The negative reviews are because the servers are having problems handling the sudden influx of... THREE TIMES AS MANY players as they had at the PEAK of the playtest... all logging in and trying to play at the same time. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198131633280\/recommended\/3767850\/","votes_up":9},{"recommendationid":"230558269","appid":3767850,"accountid":104737219,"playtime_at_review":166,"review_text":"Old school Ragnarok players will love this game. It is (purposefully) very similar to the pre-p2w RO back in the day. Would recommend if that sounds fun to you. Give it a few days for server issues to be worked out, though. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198065002947\/recommended\/3767850\/","votes_up":6},{"recommendationid":"230576655","appid":3767850,"accountid":90926787,"playtime_at_review":136,"review_text":"The beta for this game was stellar, really enjoyed how it felt and am really looking forward to it. There are some very bad server issues right now, but they have a very small team who have still managed to make an...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198051192515\/recommended\/3767850\/","votes_up":2},{"recommendationid":"230578073","appid":3767850,"accountid":103265685,"playtime_at_review":648,"review_text":"The game launched like any other major MMO with login waits and lag issues. And I loved every minute of it. Played this all day with friends and look forwards to continuing to level and grind mobs. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198063531413\/recommended\/3767850\/","votes_up":2}]},{"appid":228380,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"230571822","appid":228380,"accountid":48214940,"playtime_at_review":674,"review_text":"This game never gets old. Every race is complete chaos, the crashes are satisfying, and the driving feels surprisingly good. If you like arcade racing games, Wreckfest is an easy recommendation.","review_text_truncated":false,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198008480668\/recommended\/228380\/","votes_up":10}]},{"appid":4297840,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"230548854","appid":4297840,"accountid":84723713,"playtime_at_review":199,"review_text":"I enjoyed it. Starts off a little slow, and it's quite expensive for what it is (100% achievements in 3.3 hours) but it does eventually give you the feeling of swimming through the land and seeing funny numbers go up pretty...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198044989441\/recommended\/4297840\/","votes_up":9}]},{"appid":2569760,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"230525335","appid":2569760,"accountid":1090943871,"playtime_at_review":354,"review_text":"its pretty good. DO NOT Play the Prologue. Idk why you added it, it's such a goofy waste of time where you pick up a machete for no reason to do literally nothing.. but the game is pretty sick when it works. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561199051209599\/recommended\/2569760\/","votes_up":114},{"recommendationid":"230525970","appid":2569760,"accountid":31954888,"playtime_at_review":63,"review_text":"I enjoyed the demo quite a bit and at a glance the full game seems to be rather what I expected, more of what was delivered. I'm normally not one for co-op focused games like this (Some use the term friendslop), but the...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561197992220616\/recommended\/2569760\/","votes_up":62},{"recommendationid":"230521097","appid":2569760,"accountid":16932215,"playtime_at_review":692,"review_text":"EXCELLENT horror coop with sanity system! A must play to an incredible price! P.s. im loving the game but needs quite a lot of fixes in terms of UE crashes and Gameplay mechanics polished, but overall im expecting to be...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561197977197943\/recommended\/2569760\/","votes_up":10},{"recommendationid":"230528262","appid":2569760,"accountid":1023011581,"playtime_at_review":98,"review_text":"Actually gun the AI path finding for the carriage and priest needs a bit of work and also add someway to add folks through the game or steam or anything else but highly recommend","review_text_truncated":false,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198983277309\/recommended\/2569760\/","votes_up":11},{"recommendationid":"230572041","appid":2569760,"accountid":53011266,"playtime_at_review":393,"review_text":"The game is AWESOME and NOT too difficult if you play it like a stealth game :D The mechanics aren't explained and you're left having to read about them from external sources which can be a problem if you don't like looking...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198013276994\/recommended\/2569760\/","votes_up":3}]},{"appid":4380490,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"230525731","appid":4380490,"accountid":158185208,"playtime_at_review":771,"review_text":"My best friend and I loved the demo so much we were eager for the full release. We beat the full game at around 12 hours but we took our time. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198118450936\/recommended\/4380490\/","votes_up":6}]},{"appid":3159330,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"230545069","appid":3159330,"accountid":127407855,"playtime_at_review":4677,"review_text":"~ DIFFICULTY ~ \ud83d\udd32 My 90 year old grandma could play it \ud83d\udd32 Easy \u2705 Normal \ud83d\udd32 Hard \ud83d\udd32 Dark Souls ~ GRAPHICS ~ \ud83d\udd32 MS Paint \ud83d\udd32 Bad \ud83d\udd32 Meh \ud83d\udd32 Graphics dont matter in this game \ud83d\udd32 Good \u2705 Beautiful ~ MUSIC ~ \ud83d\udd32 Bad \ud83d\udd32 Not special \u2705 Good \ud83d\udd32...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198087673583\/recommended\/3159330\/","votes_up":10}]},{"appid":2524850,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"230544146","appid":2524850,"accountid":786932740,"playtime_at_review":60,"review_text":"I just finished the first region\/boss. BUY THIS GAME! Aside from being addicting as hell, Denshattack manages to hit the perfect balance of challenging but fair. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198747198468\/recommended\/2524850\/","votes_up":35},{"recommendationid":"230553941","appid":2524850,"accountid":105228196,"playtime_at_review":703,"review_text":"I was given access to the game a week ahead of time thanks to my work and I can confirm this is one of the sickest video games ever made. Go into it blind, let yourself be sucked in, you're in for a wild ride. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198065493924\/recommended\/2524850\/","votes_up":13},{"recommendationid":"230544644","appid":2524850,"accountid":1055012502,"playtime_at_review":974,"review_text":"This game is easily a 10\/10, the best game I've played this year. Every level introduces new ideas, and there isn't a single boring level in the entire game It's crazy. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561199015278230\/recommended\/2524850\/","votes_up":15},{"recommendationid":"230583767","appid":2524850,"accountid":257966236,"playtime_at_review":85,"review_text":"\u201cAm I high?\u201d Type ahh game Only at Act 2 but first boss set the tone, this shi is gold. Good OST, nice controls, beautiful atmosphere, good interpretation of speed.. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198218231964\/recommended\/2524850\/","votes_up":5},{"recommendationid":"230540434","appid":2524850,"accountid":177481277,"playtime_at_review":497,"review_text":"Gosh, I love this game. It's just fun and reminded me a lot of a more polished Jet Set Radio with crazy levels, wild tricks to perform, lots of cool mechanics, and a super intriguing dystopian setting to explore that really...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198137747005\/recommended\/2524850\/","votes_up":20},{"recommendationid":"230546803","appid":2524850,"accountid":242049920,"playtime_at_review":62,"review_text":"It was an absolute rush from the moment you hit the gas until you crossed the finish line. The visual design, the soundtracks and the vibe you get riding the train through the levels are just incredible. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198202315648\/recommended\/2524850\/","votes_up":5},{"recommendationid":"230588839","appid":2524850,"accountid":32204819,"playtime_at_review":422,"review_text":"Tony Hawk \/ SSX but with trains. But also JAPAN. And also beautiful, over the top and unique bossfights. Multitrack drifting. Insane music (look at that cast). And its also Sonic?? ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561197992470547\/recommended\/2524850\/","votes_up":3}]},{"appid":3641000,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"230567561","appid":3641000,"accountid":2383042,"playtime_at_review":700,"review_text":"I really really liked the progression mechanics of this game. Unlike the Roottrees game, I never once had to turn to the Internet for help and it genuinely has all the narrative needed to solve the game within the game...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561197962648770\/recommended\/3641000\/","votes_up":14},{"recommendationid":"230535809","appid":3641000,"accountid":44405025,"playtime_at_review":654,"review_text":"If you enjoyed Return of the Obra Dinn, but are sad you'll never get to experience it for the first time again you should really get this game. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198004670753\/recommended\/3641000\/","votes_up":11},{"recommendationid":"230551884","appid":3641000,"accountid":1197054739,"playtime_at_review":577,"review_text":"insane story, insane voice acting, insane animations, great game you could say it deserves a thunderous clap","review_text_truncated":false,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561199157320467\/recommended\/3641000\/","votes_up":7},{"recommendationid":"230576316","appid":3641000,"accountid":66733824,"playtime_at_review":750,"review_text":"\"Who\/when\/where\" fractured timeline paranormal deductive detective game with full voice acting. Good enough for me to complete it in one long 12-hour session. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198026999552\/recommended\/3641000\/","votes_up":2}]},{"appid":2209900,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"230533390","appid":2209900,"accountid":1013194692,"playtime_at_review":510,"review_text":"\u263d\ud83e\udd87\u2661 I've not been this addicted to a farming sim since Stardew Valley and Disney Dreamlight Valley, this has everything I could've wanted I love supernatural stuff so much and I love that this farming sim is revolved around...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198973460420\/recommended\/2209900\/","votes_up":9}]}],
